### Get all images.  Each request **MUST** be delimited by a triple hash
# This is a comment
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images

### Get one image by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images/69af1877a4ffe45046720e23

### Rename image (success)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69af1877a4ffe45046720e23/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New image name" }

### Rename image (bad request - missing name)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69af1877a4ffe45046720e23/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Missing name field" }

### Rename image (not found - invalid id)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/not-a-valid-id/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Will not work" }

### Rename image (content too large)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69af1877a4ffe45046720e23/name
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "This name is way too longggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggg" }

### A second example.  Each request **MUST** be delimited by a triple hash
POST http://localhost:3000/api/test
Content-Type: application/json # Content-Type header is a must if you're sending JSON
# Request body separated from headers by newline

{ "a": 1, "b": 2 }
